# The build context is this producer's own directory, and this producer needs
# NOTHING out of it. Its payload comes from the board directory, the shared
# overlay, the initramfs sources and pkgs/rauc, all of which arrive as named
# build contexts (see producer.env's BUILD_CONTEXTS), and the packer arrives as
# the `packer` context the driver passes itself.
#
# So the context is emptied rather than filtered: an edit to producer.env or to
# the PREPARE hook render.sh, neither of which the build reads, cannot invalidate
# this producer's cache, and nothing can be COPYed from there by accident.
*
